{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/eb64ed3134185b951e621f331aa684c2.avif?t=1756498737\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valkyrie Rising: Hordes of Ragnar\u00f6k </strong>is a horde-survivor roguelite where you battle against the unending hordes of Ragnar\u00f6k to save Asgard. Unleash divine powers, survive endless waves, and build unstoppable synergies in this action-packed Norse adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive endless hordes of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against epic bosses and elite enemies that test your strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield divine power by choosing up to three gods with unique skill trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master customizable active abilities that require precise timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge legendary builds by combining runes, blessings, and upgrades for limitless synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on divine quests that reward rare powers and reveal hidden lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the shattered realms of Asgard filled with different secrets and danger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by unlocking permanent upgrades  after every run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Against Hordes of Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless waves of chaos as monstrous creatures swarm the battlefield. Each wave grows deadlier\u00a0\u2014 only your skill, strategy, and willpower will keep you alive as you fight to reclaim Asgard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/6c2a78cad2b5533d5c4f3a68767ebfe2.poster.avif?t=1756498737\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/6c2a78cad2b5533d5c4f3a68767ebfe2.webm?t=1756498737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/6c2a78cad2b5533d5c4f3a68767ebfe2.mp4?t=1756498737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wield the Powers of the Gods</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Channel the might of Odin, Thor, Freyja, and more. Gain divine powers through ancient runes and god-blessed skill trees\u00a0\u2014 unleash lightning strikes, summon celestial weapons, or erupt the ground beneath your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/625ac298c8051e2c75f1412355ca7c32.poster.avif?t=1756498737\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/625ac298c8051e2c75f1412355ca7c32.webm?t=1756498737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/625ac298c8051e2c75f1412355ca7c32.mp4?t=1756498737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/552aab54d783b5ebfb703eb87a913397.poster.avif?t=1756498737\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/552aab54d783b5ebfb703eb87a913397.webm?t=1756498737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/552aab54d783b5ebfb703eb87a913397.mp4?t=1756498737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Overpowered Builds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack runes, divine powers, and gauntlet upgrades to craft ridiculous synergies. Combine projectile modifiers, passive effects, and god-given skills to forge a build that destroys everything in your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/8103fd5f5f93a0c9326a704465cec602.poster.avif?t=1756498737\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/8103fd5f5f93a0c9326a704465cec602.webm?t=1756498737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/extras/8103fd5f5f93a0c9326a704465cec602.mp4?t=1756498737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3214330?t=1756498737","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/3a22e1aaf5a40c961d7464d277333b6f84e0422b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756498737","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/4c2cd0dce7dcaaa797fba8e8b39d8e4e80657a01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756498737","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214330/4c2cd0dce7dcaaa797fba8e8b39d8e4e80657a01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756498737","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custo